WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:20.639 --> 00:00:23.956
GRAB SUN JAE AND RUN

2
00:00:45.774 --> 00:00:46.813
Have you ever...

3
00:00:47.852 --> 00:00:50.170
had an accident?

4
00:00:52.088 --> 00:00:53.088
Yes.

5
00:00:53.606 --> 00:00:55.045
10 years ago.

6
00:00:55.564 --> 00:00:57.962
But how did it happen...

7
00:00:58.082 --> 00:01:00.480
and how much it hurt me...

8
00:01:02.318 --> 00:01:03.876
I don't remember at all.

9
00:01:07.792 --> 00:01:10.030
Well, maybe it's for the better.

10
00:01:14.226 --> 00:01:15.385
You're sorry.

11
00:01:17.702 --> 00:01:19.900
I didn't understand then.

12
00:01:22.338 --> 00:01:24.815
Nothing. Happens.

13
00:01:26.773 --> 00:01:28.412
I was just worried.

14
00:01:29.850 --> 00:01:30.889
Fine.

15
00:01:32.887 --> 00:01:33.887
I still...

16
00:01:36.404 --> 00:01:37.642
...I'll speak.

17
00:01:39.121 --> 00:01:40.121
I'll speak...

18
00:01:41.758 --> 00:01:44.316
...and I will win.

19
00:01:46.713 --> 00:01:47.872
But don't worry.

20
00:01:49.111 --> 00:01:50.629
Your dream won't come true.

21
00:01:52.228 --> 00:01:53.228
Trust me.

22
00:01:57.303 --> 00:01:59.101
SERIES 3
The selection begins...

23
00:01:59.181 --> 00:02:02.378
to the Korean men's team.

24
00:02:02.458 --> 00:02:04.376
Song Jae!

25
00:02:05.774 --> 00:02:08.212
Go Sung Jae!

26
00:02:08.971 --> 00:02:11.648
Break them all, Sung Jae!

27
00:02:16.603 --> 00:02:18.482
Well done, Sung Jae!

28
00:02:20.799 --> 00:02:22.717
That's it, yes!

29
00:02:26.513 --> 00:02:29.151
- Well done!
- Congratulations!

30
00:02:33.506 --> 00:02:36.264
Ryu Sung Jae! Ryu Sung Jae! Ryu Sung Jae!

31
00:02:36.344 --> 00:02:39.940
Quiet! Quiet! Quiet! Please!

32
00:02:54.086 --> 00:02:55.485
Take your seats.

33
00:03:30.649 --> 00:03:34.326
After shoulder surgery I was forced
stop classes.

34
00:03:34.406 --> 00:03:37.483
That competition was my last.

35
00:03:37.802 --> 00:03:41.718
Then I started to really regret
about your ambitions.

36
00:03:41.798 --> 00:03:45.155
I was probably destined to become a singer.

37
00:03:49.950 --> 00:03:52.268
Is fate already sealed?

38
00:03:52.987 --> 00:03:57.183
It cannot be changed, and from it
You can’t refuse, right?

39
00:03:58.222 --> 00:04:02.098
He had a hard time because of the rumors
and comments.

40
00:04:03.297 --> 00:04:05.814
Even if that's the case, Sung Jae,

41
00:04:06.454 --> 00:04:07.493
I want...

42
00:04:08.052 --> 00:04:09.331
believe you.

43
00:04:20.639 --> 00:04:23.077
Come on, yeah! Ryu Sung Jae!

44
00:04:28.072 --> 00:04:29.830
- Sun Jae!
- Forward!

45
00:04:40.659 --> 00:04:41.778
RYU SONG JAE - 1st PLACE

46
00:04:42.218 --> 00:04:43.776
Yes!

47
00:04:59.361 --> 00:05:01.159
Well done, Sung Jae!

48
00:05:03.596 --> 00:05:05.395
Go Sung Jae!

49
00:05:24.615 --> 00:05:28.012
LAST NIGHT

50
00:05:34.006 --> 00:05:35.205
Thank you.

51
00:05:36.444 --> 00:05:37.642
I live here.

52
00:05:37.722 --> 00:05:40.639
We are neighbors, but never
did not cross paths in the yard.

53
00:05:40.719 --> 00:05:41.719
Strange!

54
00:05:42.757 --> 00:05:43.757
Come in.

55
00:05:44.755 --> 00:05:46.074
Get a good night's sleep.

56
00:05:46.154 --> 00:05:48.232
I'll see you tomorrow.

57
00:05:48.432 --> 00:05:49.432
Fine.

58
00:06:26.474 --> 00:06:30.709
Listen. She's running after Kim Tae-sung,
nothing bothers you?

59
00:06:30.789 --> 00:06:32.587
Now he's running after me.

60
00:06:33.467 --> 00:06:34.585
My fan.

61
00:06:35.425 --> 00:06:39.580
Yes, by the way. Fan and admirer -
the same thing?

62
00:06:41.738 --> 00:06:45.894
- We're not dating.
- Wow. Man!

63
00:06:49.051 --> 00:06:52.368
Have you already confessed to her? Can you?

64
00:06:52.448 --> 00:06:54.006
Me too.

65
00:06:55.165 --> 00:06:58.681
When I took my first steps, dad thought,
that a thief broke into the house.

66
00:06:58.761 --> 00:07:00.000
I walked well.

67
00:07:00.400 --> 00:07:02.757
- And what?
- I don’t have to try.

68
00:07:03.317 --> 00:07:06.753
I'll get the gold tomorrow. And I confess to her.

69
00:07:07.552 --> 00:07:09.431
You're funny. Song Jae.

70
00:07:09.670 --> 00:07:11.508
Do you think it's easy?

71
00:07:11.788 --> 00:07:14.785
Listen. Love is a difficult game.

72
00:07:15.025 --> 00:07:17.942
We have to choose the moment.

73
00:07:18.541 --> 00:07:22.258
Choose. Choose!

74
00:07:27.532 --> 00:07:29.091
Song Jae!

75
00:07:29.171 --> 00:07:30.410
Eat!

76
00:07:30.490 --> 00:07:33.566
Go Sung Jae!

77
00:07:44.076 --> 00:07:47.632
I'll get the gold tomorrow. And I confess to her.

78
00:07:52.987 --> 00:07:55.065
It must be here somewhere.

79
00:07:57.582 --> 00:08:02.018
Song Jae... Dad came to support you,
did we escape?

80
00:08:02.657 --> 00:08:03.657
Yes.

81
00:08:06.054 --> 00:08:07.852
How's the shoulder? Everything is fine?

82
00:08:08.012 --> 00:08:09.012
Yes.

83
00:08:09.810 --> 00:08:11.928
Why is he not in the mood?

84
00:08:12.847 --> 00:08:14.126
Where are we going?

85
00:08:14.925 --> 00:08:15.925
Yes.

86
00:08:16.444 --> 00:08:17.444
What?

87
00:08:18.482 --> 00:08:19.760
I didn't say?

88
00:08:20.360 --> 00:08:21.360
Let's go have lunch.

89
00:08:22.278 --> 00:08:24.795
Angry because you're hungry?

90
00:08:26.633 --> 00:08:28.072
Yes, it's time for lunch.

91
00:08:28.152 --> 00:08:30.270
I'm hungry too.
Where shall we go?

92
00:08:31.628 --> 00:08:35.025
When we see a good cafe,
Let's go right in.

93
00:08:35.944 --> 00:08:37.423
Finally tell me!

94
00:08:38.022 --> 00:08:40.460
What healthy food could I feed him?

95
00:08:42.218 --> 00:08:44.136
- Here?
- Let's go there!

96
00:08:46.014 --> 00:08:48.931
Salt... Missed the chance!

97
00:08:52.128 --> 00:08:54.046
Good only on the outside...

98
00:08:54.965 --> 00:08:57.522
You did great
but don't forget about your health.

99
00:08:57.842 --> 00:08:59.361
Do you like it hot?

100
00:09:03.317 --> 00:09:04.476
They brought it.

101
00:09:26.733 --> 00:09:28.012
Blow and eat.

102
00:09:36.484 --> 00:09:39.241
No one has ever been as lucky as me...

103
00:09:39.321 --> 00:09:40.321
What?

104
00:09:41.838 --> 00:09:43.836
I'm having lunch with you.

105
00:09:44.595 --> 00:09:46.354
This is a success for otakus.

106
00:09:47.512 --> 00:09:49.111
Who are these otakus?

107
00:09:50.669 --> 00:09:52.108
Basically, fans.

108
00:09:52.188 --> 00:09:53.826
Told you I was a fan.

109
00:09:56.623 --> 00:09:57.662
Swimming.

110
00:09:58.102 --> 00:09:59.102
Swimming.

111
00:10:00.300 --> 00:10:02.857
Are a fan and an admirer the same thing?

112
00:10:05.415 --> 00:10:07.373
Kim Tae Sun, that bass player...

113
00:10:07.572 --> 00:10:09.171
Yes. What's wrong with him?

114
00:10:09.850 --> 00:10:11.089
Do you like...

115
00:10:11.728 --> 00:10:12.887
how's the guy?

116
00:10:13.966 --> 00:10:17.163
How could you come up with this?
Not at all.

117
00:10:17.922 --> 00:10:18.922
Not at all?

118
00:10:23.437 --> 00:10:24.476
Why the question?

119
00:10:27.752 --> 00:10:29.351
I saw you together yesterday.

120
00:10:29.870 --> 00:10:31.708
I was just curious.

121
00:10:33.227 --> 00:10:34.227
You eat.

122
00:10:45.495 --> 00:10:49.131
Thank you. I really wanted to treat you.

123
00:10:50.370 --> 00:10:52.727
Next time you pay.

124
00:10:53.806 --> 00:10:57.403
It's coming. Next time it will be even tastier!

125
00:10:57.602 --> 00:11:00.360
We have to choose the moment.

126
00:11:01.638 --> 00:11:04.555
Wow. How beautiful it is here!

127
00:11:05.475 --> 00:11:08.032
By the way, why did you call me?

128
00:11:09.231 --> 00:11:10.310
And here's the moment?

129
00:11:14.146 --> 00:11:17.023
I wanted to apologize for yesterday.

130
00:11:17.103 --> 00:11:20.340
Apologize? Everything is fine, what are you doing?

131
00:11:22.298 --> 00:11:23.298
This is the moment.

132
00:11:25.974 --> 00:11:28.332
And I also wanted...

133
00:11:28.851 --> 00:11:31.808
Confess... Prize... Prize...
Frankly...

134
00:11:32.687 --> 00:11:34.685
- Do you want a prize?
- Confess?

135
00:11:34.845 --> 00:11:36.284
- What?
- What?

136
00:11:36.563 --> 00:11:38.961
- Give it to me for a prize.
- What? Frankly...

137
00:11:39.121 --> 00:11:44.036
Give... Confess... Give for a prize?
Now. Here. Here's your prize.

138
00:11:44.316 --> 00:11:45.316
Wow!

139
00:11:48.551 --> 00:11:49.630
What's the prize?

140
00:11:49.990 --> 00:11:51.069
Photo!

141
00:11:52.268 --> 00:11:53.268
What?

142
00:11:54.066 --> 00:11:55.784
There's also a passport photo.

143
00:11:56.623 --> 00:11:58.342
Let's take a photo.

144
00:12:00.100 --> 00:12:01.100
Well?

145
00:12:06.653 --> 00:12:11.169
I was so jealous of the fans
who took pictures with him!

146
00:12:12.647 --> 00:12:14.645
- Do you want to go together?
- Yes!

147
00:12:18.442 --> 00:12:20.400
I don't really like taking pictures.

148
00:12:22.957 --> 00:12:24.476
I see...

149
00:12:26.474 --> 00:12:28.472
- It won't work...
- It’s baking!

150
00:12:29.311 --> 00:12:31.508
God. It got so hot.

151
00:12:31.988 --> 00:12:34.466
We can come in. Okay, here.

152
00:12:38.741 --> 00:12:41.099
Wrong way... Sung Jae!

153
00:12:41.259 --> 00:12:43.337
PASSPORT PHOTO
START

154
00:12:46.414 --> 00:12:48.771
That's it, let's begin. Get ready.

155
00:12:49.890 --> 00:12:50.890
Look into the camera.

156
00:12:51.528 --> 00:12:53.526
Where? Here?

157
00:12:58.042 --> 00:12:59.201
No!

158
00:12:59.760 --> 00:13:01.039
Look here.

159
00:13:02.118 --> 00:13:03.118
There?

160
00:13:04.356 --> 00:13:06.034
One, two...

161
00:13:06.114 --> 00:13:07.233
Smile!

162
00:13:16.224 --> 00:13:18.222
What's going on with you?

163
00:13:20.420 --> 00:13:22.058
Try this.

164
00:13:22.897 --> 00:13:25.335
What is this? Tumor?

165
00:13:26.094 --> 00:13:29.610
Tumor? What a tumor, this heart!

166
00:13:30.010 --> 00:13:31.010
What are you talking about?

167
00:13:31.369 --> 00:13:33.127
I won't do that.

168
00:13:33.207 --> 00:13:34.326
I won't. No. No.

169
00:13:34.406 --> 00:13:36.763
- Get ready.
- They're filming, they're filming!

170
00:13:37.243 --> 00:13:40.999
- Come on faster!
- One, two, three!

171
00:13:47.193 --> 00:13:48.193
Are you satisfied?

172
00:13:57.103 --> 00:13:58.302
Here's the moment.

173
00:13:59.101 --> 00:14:00.101
Listen...

174
00:14:02.577 --> 00:14:03.577
Here he is.

175
00:14:04.096 --> 00:14:05.255
Such a thing...

176
00:14:06.294 --> 00:14:07.294
Yes?

177
00:14:08.771 --> 00:14:09.771
You...

178
00:14:12.967 --> 00:14:14.965
- ...to me...
- Done!

179
00:14:16.404 --> 00:14:17.762
Ready! Wait.

180
00:14:23.197 --> 00:14:24.875
How nice!

181
00:14:27.113 --> 00:14:29.271
Wow, they came out great!

182
00:14:30.070 --> 00:14:31.748
Which one is better?

183
00:14:37.502 --> 00:14:38.581
Confessed?

184
00:14:39.461 --> 00:14:40.939
Where is it...

185
00:14:55.724 --> 00:14:58.162
Yes. Not a bad moment...

186
00:15:00.599 --> 00:15:02.118
- Listen...
- Better shut up.

187
00:15:03.157 --> 00:15:04.157
What?

188
00:15:10.110 --> 00:15:11.628
How it turns...

189
00:15:12.627 --> 00:15:14.386
An accident, or what?

190
00:15:14.466 --> 00:15:16.503
The car shouldn't be parked here.

191
00:15:16.623 --> 00:15:17.623
What?

192
00:15:18.541 --> 00:15:19.541
What's happened?

193
00:15:22.537 --> 00:15:24.575
Nothing. Nothing.

194
00:15:26.334 --> 00:15:29.051
How to tell your idol that nature is calling?

195
00:15:29.131 --> 00:15:31.888
Mom, I really want to go to the toilet...

196
00:15:31.968 --> 00:15:33.287
Oh my God.

197
00:15:33.606 --> 00:15:37.203
-Can’t wait until you stop?
- I won't stand it.

198
00:15:37.642 --> 00:15:39.321
Stop the bus?

199
00:15:39.401 --> 00:15:42.478
Yes, yes! Ask the driver for me!

200
00:15:42.557 --> 00:15:43.796
Are you sure you can’t stand it?

201
00:15:43.876 --> 00:15:45.355
You won't tolerate it. Come on, come on!

202
00:15:45.435 --> 00:15:47.512
Mom, I want to go to the toilet!

203
00:15:47.592 --> 00:15:50.150
Now I'm going to pee my pants!

204
00:15:50.230 --> 00:15:51.349
My God. Wait.

205
00:15:51.429 --> 00:15:52.947
Please! Please!

206
00:15:57.343 --> 00:15:58.343
So.

207
00:16:00.739 --> 00:16:03.097
Go here. I'll hide you.

208
00:16:07.612 --> 00:16:08.612
Driver!

209
00:16:10.370 --> 00:16:11.648
Stop the bus.

210
00:16:12.368 --> 00:16:14.645
Right here? What's happened?

211
00:16:15.485 --> 00:16:19.001
I urgently need to leave.

212
00:16:19.081 --> 00:16:20.081
What?

213
00:16:20.280 --> 00:16:23.796
- We were just stopping...
- Please...

214
00:16:33.986 --> 00:16:34.986
Thank you!

215
00:16:36.104 --> 00:16:37.104
Thank you.

216
00:16:42.018 --> 00:16:45.894
You run to the toilet
I'll get some fresh air there for now.

217
00:16:48.332 --> 00:16:49.332
It's dangerous there.

218
00:16:51.009 --> 00:16:52.168
Go there.

219
00:16:53.367 --> 00:16:54.367
What?

220
00:16:54.765 --> 00:16:56.603
Go quickly. I...

221
00:16:57.363 --> 00:16:58.681
I'll watch over you.

222
00:17:00.839 --> 00:17:01.839
Me?

223
00:17:07.992 --> 00:17:09.670
Complete failure!

224
00:17:15.744 --> 00:17:17.223
Probably...

225
00:17:18.981 --> 00:17:20.100
not that moment.

226
00:17:21.698 --> 00:17:22.698
No.

227
00:17:26.014 --> 00:17:28.292
GYMA VIDEO AND DVD

228
00:17:33.566 --> 00:17:37.882
Again? All toilets work
Only yours gets clogged all the time.

229
00:17:37.962 --> 00:17:40.480
- Listen, I...
- You wash it off.

230
00:17:40.559 --> 00:17:44.595
- No, I...
- Do not throw paper into it.

231
00:17:44.715 --> 00:17:49.950
- I don’t throw it away.
- What do you eat if the toilet is clogged?

232
00:17:58.821 --> 00:18:01.578
Until then, you'll figure it out on your own.
I'll come over later...

233
00:18:02.617 --> 00:18:04.895
Do we have a rat?

234
00:18:20.599 --> 00:18:21.638
What?

235
00:18:24.555 --> 00:18:26.274
Exactly this guy.

236
00:18:26.673 --> 00:18:28.751
So funny, really.

237
00:18:47.612 --> 00:18:48.691
That's it.

238
00:18:51.888 --> 00:18:53.846
You're doing great, Sung Jae.

239
00:18:54.206 --> 00:18:56.883
Congratulations on your gold medal.

240
00:19:18.781 --> 00:19:21.139
What? It's summer.

241
00:19:23.057 --> 00:19:24.057
Lim Sol.

242
00:19:27.293 --> 00:19:29.091
Thank you for coming.

243
00:19:31.129 --> 00:19:34.765
I'll follow you to the other side of the world.

244
00:19:36.204 --> 00:19:37.204
No...

245
00:19:39.361 --> 00:19:41.678
if you were in a different decade,

246
00:19:42.478 --> 00:19:45.914
I would rush to you through time.

247
00:19:51.389 --> 00:19:53.027
I'm your fan.

248
00:19:55.425 --> 00:19:57.103
How long will this last?

249
00:19:57.742 --> 00:19:59.620
- What?
- I...

250
00:20:00.979 --> 00:20:02.817
no more fangirl needed.

251
00:20:03.976 --> 00:20:05.894
Why? How so?

252
00:20:08.132 --> 00:20:10.969
- You...
- But I have to be there!

253
00:20:12.328 --> 00:20:13.846
- I...
- Do you want to be friends?

254
00:20:14.885 --> 00:20:16.044
Let's be friends!

255
00:20:31.748 --> 00:20:33.866
And what? Can you not try?

256
00:20:36.663 --> 00:20:39.900
Since you are silent, it means
never confessed, coward.

257
00:20:39.980 --> 00:20:42.697
I arranged such romance for you there!

258
00:20:43.297 --> 00:20:45.175
What? Don't need a fan?

259
00:20:45.694 --> 00:20:48.052
God, there were so many words...

260
00:20:48.452 --> 00:20:51.249
- “This sucks.” Who would say...
- Shut up.

261
00:20:51.409 --> 00:20:53.966
Who? Who? Who asked you?

262
00:20:54.046 --> 00:20:55.724
You didn't get kicked out!

263
00:20:57.682 --> 00:20:58.682
Didn't they turn you off?

264
00:20:59.161 --> 00:21:00.639
God.

265
00:21:01.518 --> 00:21:03.437
What else can I say?

266
00:21:03.876 --> 00:21:05.315
You didn't admit it.

267
00:21:08.991 --> 00:21:10.270
Exactly.

268
00:21:13.586 --> 00:21:14.586
And it's true.

269
00:21:17.183 --> 00:21:19.580
If you were in a different decade...

270
00:21:20.260 --> 00:21:23.736
I would rush to you through time.

271
00:21:34.525 --> 00:21:36.843
JAGAM HIGH SCHOOL

272
00:22:00.859 --> 00:22:02.737
- Wow!
- Cool!

273
00:22:10.649 --> 00:22:12.887
- Sun Jae!
- Sun Jae! Song Jae!

274
00:22:33.626 --> 00:22:35.744
Why isn't Sun Jae visible?

275
00:22:37.502 --> 00:22:39.780
Granny, are you settled in well?

276
00:22:41.259 --> 00:22:42.378
What are you doing?

277
00:22:43.217 --> 00:22:45.614
An interesting hobby.

278
00:22:46.494 --> 00:22:49.131
And I thought you came to me.

