You can also say fate.

547
00:41:52.507 --> 00:41:55.465
Don't worry, Sol will pay you back.

548
00:41:55.544 --> 00:41:58.102
Another trick to please me?

549
00:41:58.941 --> 00:41:59.941
Don't try.

550
00:42:00.060 --> 00:42:02.617
Come on. Go.

551
00:42:06.933 --> 00:42:08.531
- What?
- You...

552
00:42:09.331 --> 00:42:10.569
...got dirty.

553
00:42:11.169 --> 00:42:12.169
Where?

554
00:42:12.368 --> 00:42:13.806
- Here.
- Here?

555
00:42:13.886 --> 00:42:14.886
Here, here.

556
00:42:16.484 --> 00:42:17.484
All?

557
00:42:19.001 --> 00:42:20.040
There is nothing.

558
00:42:20.839 --> 00:42:21.839
Gorgeous.

559
00:42:22.677 --> 00:42:25.435
Lovelace. All of you are beauties.

560
00:42:58.521 --> 00:43:00.040
I didn't go to school.

561
00:43:00.839 --> 00:43:03.077
Why are you lying here all day?

562
00:43:13.467 --> 00:43:14.505
Dad...

563
00:43:28.252 --> 00:43:31.369
And why did you take so long
is it a secret?

564
00:43:32.008 --> 00:43:34.366
Will someone scold you?

565
00:43:34.446 --> 00:43:37.842
will he be angry with you because of the operation?
Tell?

566
00:43:40.519 --> 00:43:43.037
God. My idiot.

567
00:43:43.996 --> 00:43:47.353
You think you're already an adult
have you outgrown your father?

568
00:43:48.392 --> 00:43:52.028
If you feel bad, you need to immediately
tell me about this!

569
00:43:52.428 --> 00:43:54.865
Now I feel guilty!

570
00:43:55.784 --> 00:43:56.784
Sorry.

571
00:44:03.377 --> 00:44:04.535
My God.

572
00:44:05.255 --> 00:44:08.971
And I didn't know anything
I arranged such a feast.

573
00:44:20.519 --> 00:44:23.117
The doctor said my condition is bad.

574
00:44:24.116 --> 00:44:25.116
Yes.

575
00:44:32.507 --> 00:44:35.504
We need to start treatment soon!

576
00:44:36.344 --> 00:44:38.222
Do you want to lose your hand?

577
00:44:45.415 --> 00:44:49.011
We'll go to the hospital on Monday
Let's set a date.

578
00:44:51.369 --> 00:44:53.407
Let's sort out your shoulder.

579
00:44:55.005 --> 00:44:57.283
And then think

580
00:44:57.483 --> 00:44:59.640
rehabilitate or leave.

581
00:45:01.079 --> 00:45:02.278
Sorry.

582
00:45:06.633 --> 00:45:08.871
Puppy. He also apologizes.

583
00:45:16.583 --> 00:45:17.742
Song Jae.

584
00:45:25.894 --> 00:45:27.972
Hand... The hand does not rise.

585
00:45:31.928 --> 00:45:32.928
Yes.

586
00:45:33.526 --> 00:45:34.845
I relaxed.

587
00:45:35.844 --> 00:45:37.243
Became a rag.

588
00:45:38.921 --> 00:45:43.157
I almost finished you right here
I would sit quietly...

589
00:45:43.237 --> 00:45:44.476
And you say this

590
00:45:44.555 --> 00:45:47.193
that everything inside me is shrinking.

591
00:45:48.911 --> 00:45:49.911
Crap.

592
00:45:51.748 --> 00:45:52.947
I'll pour it for you.

593
00:46:00.380 --> 00:46:02.617
I returned that tape.

594
00:46:03.936 --> 00:46:07.333
Son, take what you want
and look at yourself calmly!

595
00:46:07.413 --> 00:46:11.968
And you hid the tape, and I had to
pay 11 dollars.

596
00:46:12.168 --> 00:46:14.965
- No, dad, I...
- And it turns out that you are with us,

597
00:46:15.045 --> 00:46:16.324
you like to be silent.

598
00:46:16.404 --> 00:46:18.681
How did you like the film?

599
00:46:19.680 --> 00:46:22.038
- I didn’t watch it, dad!
- Dunce.

600
00:46:22.118 --> 00:46:25.115
HUSAN UNIVERSITY HOSPITAL

601
00:46:25.195 --> 00:46:27.752
The operation was successful.

602
00:46:28.432 --> 00:46:35.345
But the supraspinatus and subscapularis muscles
almost completely torn.

603
00:46:35.425 --> 00:46:37.702
And the labrum is damaged.

604
00:46:37.782 --> 00:46:39.381
Wait, doctor...

605
00:46:39.461 --> 00:46:42.817
That is, the shoulder is completely
deformed.

606
00:46:43.377 --> 00:46:49.890
Unfortunately, as a doctor I cannot
guarantee your future career.

607
00:46:50.649 --> 00:46:51.649
I'm sorry.

608
00:46:52.368 --> 00:46:53.368
God...

609
00:47:52.907 --> 00:47:54.625
Why are you crying?

610
00:48:02.458 --> 00:48:03.536
Wow...

611
00:48:26.194 --> 00:48:27.912
- Thank you!
- Thank you!

612
00:48:27.992 --> 00:48:29.151
Tasty!

613
00:48:29.790 --> 00:48:33.666
CURE OUR SUN JAE
Your fan brought it. Very tasty!

614
00:48:44.575 --> 00:48:49.211
A WEEK LATER

615
00:48:51.968 --> 00:48:53.327
Hello!

616
00:48:54.126 --> 00:48:55.165
And you...

617
00:48:57.682 --> 00:48:59.960
Fan of Sung Jae! Yes, exactly.

618
00:49:00.040 --> 00:49:03.437
The cupcakes were so delicious, thank you.

619
00:49:03.796 --> 00:49:05.155
What's happened?

620
00:49:06.194 --> 00:49:08.072
I live in the next house.

621
00:49:08.591 --> 00:49:10.430
Has Sun Jae been discharged yet?

622
00:49:11.109 --> 00:49:13.626
So we are neighbors, it turns out.

623
00:49:13.826 --> 00:49:16.144
Yes, Sun Jae was discharged.
What, should I call him?

624
00:49:16.224 --> 00:49:18.342
No. Let him rest.

625
00:49:19.341 --> 00:49:23.497
Here. It's so hot,
grandma cooked chicken soup.

626
00:49:26.533 --> 00:49:27.892
My God!

627
00:49:28.172 --> 00:49:29.930
This is for you and Sung Jae, take it.

628
00:49:30.330 --> 00:49:32.887
I don’t even feel comfortable taking it somehow.

629
00:49:32.967 --> 00:49:34.246
Take it!

630
00:49:34.326 --> 00:49:37.762
There were three chickens here.
Where did the two go?

631
00:49:37.842 --> 00:49:38.961
Help yourself.

632
00:49:39.680 --> 00:49:44.276
Fine. Please tell grandma
Hello and thank you from me.

633
00:49:44.356 --> 00:49:47.033
No, no, wait here, wait.

634
00:49:48.711 --> 00:49:52.028
Here. This is lemongrass. I made the tincture myself.

635
00:49:52.108 --> 00:49:57.742
In the summer you take one sip,
and immediately it becomes so easy, so fresh.

636
00:49:57.822 --> 00:50:00.779
Immediately the body relaxes.
The best escape from the heat.

637
00:50:01.099 --> 00:50:02.937
OK, thank you!

638
00:50:16.044 --> 00:50:19.840
What a good tincture!
Both sweet and sour.

639
00:50:32.987 --> 00:50:36.264
It got so hot. Probably because of the weather.

640
00:50:43.177 --> 00:50:44.177
In terms of?

641
00:50:47.213 --> 00:50:48.651
When did I have time?

642
00:50:53.646 --> 00:50:55.844
It's stuffy. God.

643
00:51:00.959 --> 00:51:02.318
Chilly.

644
00:52:15.884 --> 00:52:17.243
Damn...

645
00:52:21.638 --> 00:52:23.317
Come on.

646
00:52:31.548 --> 00:52:32.548
You again?

647
00:52:33.786 --> 00:52:35.145
Me again.

648
00:52:35.425 --> 00:52:38.581
Sorry, I didn't mean to disturb you.

649
00:52:41.339 --> 00:52:42.537
Are you drunk?

650
00:52:44.056 --> 00:52:45.056
No.

651
00:52:53.686 --> 00:52:55.125
And it smells like fumes.

652
00:52:55.684 --> 00:52:58.362
What are you saying?

653
00:52:59.760 --> 00:53:00.959
And the face is red.

654
00:53:01.918 --> 00:53:06.194
Your dad treated me
lemongrass tincture, I drank it.

655
00:53:06.434 --> 00:53:08.831
So I felt stuffy.

656
00:53:09.510 --> 00:53:11.469
Did your dad treat you to some tincture?

657
00:53:17.143 --> 00:53:19.540
Salt! She's alcoholic!

658
00:53:20.619 --> 00:53:24.416
What? You can't smell the alcohol there!

659
00:53:24.496 --> 00:53:26.334
There's so much alcohol in it...

660
00:53:27.652 --> 00:53:31.369
- How are you?
- Come on. And what will happen to me from this?

661
00:53:33.167 --> 00:53:35.005
- What?
- Everything is fine.

662
00:53:35.604 --> 00:53:36.604
What?

663
00:53:40.959 --> 00:53:42.038
Got drunk.

664
00:53:43.916 --> 00:53:44.916
Come here.

665
00:54:02.458 --> 00:54:03.497
Song Jae...

666
00:54:06.054 --> 00:54:07.253
Tell me.

667
00:54:07.812 --> 00:54:11.169
Are your parents gardeners by any chance?

668
00:54:12.248 --> 00:54:14.086
Where did they get this...

669
00:54:14.246 --> 00:54:15.246
What?

670
00:54:17.043 --> 00:54:18.122
Flower.

671
00:54:21.439 --> 00:54:23.596
How much do you need to drink?

672
00:54:23.676 --> 00:54:26.114
Or maybe they are jewelers?

673
00:54:26.194 --> 00:54:27.992
- Enough.
- Such a sweetie.

674
00:54:28.072 --> 00:54:31.868
- Stop it.
- What don't you like? What a bore!

675
00:54:31.948 --> 00:54:34.585
- Seriously!
- Treasure...

676
00:54:38.981 --> 00:54:41.099
Not funny. Enough.

677
00:54:41.818 --> 00:54:45.614
Crap. And before, Sun Jae always laughed
with jokes like this.

678
00:54:47.013 --> 00:54:48.332
It didn't work out.

679
00:54:52.008 --> 00:54:54.126
Shall we listen to music then?

680
00:55:04.795 --> 00:55:05.795
Here you go.

681
00:55:24.615 --> 00:55:27.612
He often sang this song to fans.

682
00:56:12.567 --> 00:56:13.567
That's good.

683
00:56:16.124 --> 00:56:17.602
One shoulder works.

684
00:56:58.961 --> 00:57:00.879
This is my idol!

685
00:57:06.953 --> 00:57:07.953
What?

686
00:57:11.349 --> 00:57:12.707
Let's go. It's time already.

687
00:57:13.067 --> 00:57:14.067
What?

688
00:57:14.386 --> 00:57:15.824
Are you talking?

689
00:57:15.984 --> 00:57:20.579
Wow. Straight from the picture.
Can you still move?

690
00:57:21.259 --> 00:57:23.097
Funny. Very fun.

691
00:58:11.808 --> 00:58:12.808
Salt.

692
00:58:18.002 --> 00:58:19.002
You...

693
00:58:21.598 --> 00:58:22.598
I like you.

694
00:58:31.389 --> 00:58:33.347
Smile like that always.

695
00:58:35.744 --> 00:58:36.943
And I...

696
00:58:38.102 --> 00:58:39.660
I'll be there.

697
00:58:40.859 --> 00:58:45.694
So that you don't feel lonely,
so you don't think about bad things...

698
00:58:47.133 --> 00:58:50.130
I will be by your side all my life.

699
00:58:51.888 --> 00:58:53.287
So don't die...

700
00:59:23.377 --> 00:59:25.015
My head...

701
00:59:42.478 --> 00:59:45.115
I remember that we listened to music together.

702
00:59:46.434 --> 00:59:49.910
I haven't gotten that drunk in a long time.

703
00:59:51.548 --> 00:59:55.345
Maybe I did something else yesterday?

704
00:59:56.424 --> 00:59:58.661
I don't know...

705
01:00:12.288 --> 01:00:13.288
Where are you going?

706
01:00:22.757 --> 01:00:24.755
This is my idol!

707
01:00:25.714 --> 01:00:26.753
You start again.

708
01:00:28.232 --> 01:00:30.509
- Let's go. It's time already.
- What? What kind of recording is this?

709
01:00:30.589 --> 01:00:33.187
What? Are you talking?

710
01:00:33.267 --> 01:00:38.142
- I'm crazy!
- Can you still move?

711
01:00:44.735 --> 01:00:45.774
Kim Tae Sun.

712
01:00:46.134 --> 01:00:48.811
You were recently spotted with a girl.

713
01:00:48.971 --> 01:00:49.971
Who is she?

714
01:00:50.809 --> 01:00:52.328
You don't need to know.

715
01:00:56.324 --> 01:00:57.562
Is this Lim Sol?

716
01:00:58.122 --> 01:01:00.240
I saw you drop her off.

717
01:01:00.320 --> 01:01:03.956
You've never given me a lift,
and for what?

718
01:01:04.356 --> 01:01:06.993
What, are you dating?

719
01:01:09.111 --> 01:01:10.430
What kind of question is this?

720
01:01:11.069 --> 01:01:12.188
Can't we?

721
01:01:12.268 --> 01:01:13.666
It is forbidden!

722
01:01:13.906 --> 01:01:16.703
Can you date someone like that?

723
01:01:19.900 --> 01:01:21.339
Damn...

724
01:01:23.017 --> 01:01:25.175
Show me what I can do?

725
01:02:06.773 --> 01:02:08.651
Funny. Very fun.

726
01:02:11.369 --> 01:02:13.526
So what will I do next?

727
01:02:19.081 --> 01:02:20.320
So we met.

728
01:02:20.919 --> 01:02:21.919
Granny?

729
01:02:23.197 --> 01:02:24.515
Kim Tae Sun?

730
01:02:26.234 --> 01:02:27.832
- What?
- Salt.

731
01:02:29.431 --> 01:02:30.431
Let's meet.

732
01:02:33.067 --> 01:02:34.067
What?

733
01:02:34.545 --> 01:02:35.545
You...

734
01:02:36.903 --> 01:02:38.102
I like you.

735
01:03:22.178 --> 01:03:23.856
This is Kim Tae Sun...

736
01:03:23.936 --> 01:03:25.415
You like me.

737
01:03:25.734 --> 01:03:27.612
What, you don't want to?

738
01:03:28.691 --> 01:03:29.691
No.

739
01:03:31.049 --> 01:03:32.168
Want.

740
01:03:42.198 --> 01:03:43.596
Ryu Sung Jae of ECLIPSE PASSES AWAY

741
01:04:09.810 --> 01:04:12.807
GRAB SUN JAE AND RUN

742
01:04:13.287 --> 01:04:16.004
I can change everything. We must go back!

743
01:04:16.204 --> 01:04:18.362
- Sun Jae!
- Go away, evil spirit!

744
01:04:18.442 --> 01:04:21.079
What have you done, Sol?

745
01:04:21.159 --> 01:04:24.316
Everything is fine? Didn't know that I was for you
I like it so much.

746
01:04:24.396 --> 01:04:25.714
- Funny.
- Don't look.

747
01:04:25.794 --> 01:04:28.591
Don't you really understand?

748
01:04:28.671 --> 01:04:30.270
That's it, that's it, don't!

749
01:04:30.549 --> 01:04:33.826
I mean... You got drunk
and don't remember anything?

750
01:04:33.906 --> 01:04:36.384
- Sorry.
- He said don't come near.

751
01:04:36.464 --> 01:04:38.741
What should I do, Sung Jae?

752
01:04:38.981 --> 01:04:41.299
You won't give me what I want.

753
01:04:41.499 --> 01:04:46.853
Did I lose my memories or you?

754
01:04:47.013 --> 01:04:49.610
Translated and voiced by the studio
"Mobile TV"

755
01:04:49.690 --> 01:04:51.888
commissioned by the online cinema Ivy
in 2024.

